{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(input: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Count non-overlapping, case-sensitive occurrences of 'std' in the input string.\n    Returns 0 for empty or too-short inputs.\n    \"\"\"\n    substring_to_find = \"std\"\n    count = 0\n    start_index = 0\n    \n    while True:\n        index = input.find(substring_to_find, start_index)\n        if index == -1:\n            break\n        count += 1\n        start_index = index + len(substring_to_find)\n        \n    return count"}
