{"task_id": "Mbpp/290", "solution": "from typing import List, Any, Tuple\n\ndef max_length(list_of_lists: List[List[Any]]) -> Tuple[int, List[Any]]:\n    \"\"\"Return (max_length, example_sublist) for the given list_of_lists.\n\n    Behavior note: If list_of_lists is empty, returns (0, []).\n    The function returns one of the sublists that attains the maximum length.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return (0, [])\n\n    max_len = 0\n    max_sublist: List[Any] = []\n\n    for sublist in list_of_lists:\n        current_len = len(sublist)\n        if current_len > max_len:\n            max_len = current_len\n            max_sublist = sublist\n\n    return (max_len, max_sublist)"}
