{"task_id": "Mbpp/433", "solution": "def isGreater(a, b):\n    \"\"\"Return True if a > b using Python's numeric comparison semantics.\"\"\"\n    return a > b\n\ndef check_greater(array, number):\n    \"\"\"Returns True iff the number is strictly greater than every element in the array.\"\"\"\n\n    # Empty array behavior: accepted and vacuously true, as per design.\n    if not array:\n        return True\n\n    for element in array:\n        if not isGreater(number, element):\n            return False\n    return True"}
