{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "def right_insertion(sequence, value):\n    \"\"\"\n    Locates the right insertion point for a specified value in a sorted sequence.\n    The index returned is immediately after the last equal element, maintaining sorted order.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(sequence)\n\n    while low < high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if sequence[mid] <= value:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid\n    return low"}
