{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "def sum_in_range(l, r):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all odd natural numbers within the inclusive range [l, r].\n    Natural numbers are integers >= 1.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    start_num = max(1, l)\n\n    for num in range(start_num, r + 1):\n        if num % 2 != 0:\n            total_sum += num\n            \n    return total_sum"}
