{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(a, b) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Return True iff for every index i in range(min(len(a), len(b))) we have b[i] < a[i].\n\n    Preconditions: a and b must be Python tuples. Function does not modify a or b.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_len = min(len(a), len(b))\n    for i in range(min_len):\n        if not (b[i] < a[i]):\n            return False\n    return True"}
